  "body": "<a name=\"release-1-18-18-fixed\"></a>\n\n### Bug fixes\n\n- Pressing Ctrl-C during a command that works on several environments at once, such as `pipx upgrade-all`, could hang pipx forever; it now stops ([#2473](https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2473)) by @gaborbernat.\n\n[🐍 PyPI release](https://pypi.org/project/pipx/1.18.18/)\n\n[📜 Full Changelog](https://github.com/pypa/pipx/compare/1.18.17...1.18.18)\n",
